# Generative AI Course (AbdullahAbuHassann)

The source repo for the `GenerativeAICourse/lessons/` markdown files already in this corpus. The agent can fetch the README for context on the course structure, or ingest the lesson files directly (already saved locally in `sources/GenerativeAICourse/lessons/`).

Covers: LLMs, prompt engineering, RAG, agents, MCP, fine-tuning, evaluation, LLMOps, ethics, case studies.

